{"title": "JULLIANY SOUZA - AH, JESUS / CORAÇÃO IGUAL AO TEU (LETRA)", "description": "Ah, Jesus / Heart Like Yours - Julliany Souza (Official Lyrics)<br><br>▸ Watch my playlist: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLgxwqHvS2Kfc_HcZR715LSLT_7yh_gQxQ\">JULLIANY SOUZA COMPLETO 2026</a><br><br>▸ Subscribe to the channel: @JullianySouza<br>▸ Listen on digital platforms: <a href=\"https://ada.lnk.to/AhJesusCoracaoIgualaoTeu\">https://ada.lnk.to/AhJesusCoracaoIgua...</a><br><br>▸ Contact for bookings/invitations:<br><br>+55 (62) 98154-8834 (WhatsApp - Rony)<br><br>▸ Lyrics:<br><br>Those who have been forgiven much<br>Should know the value of being loved<br>But on the other hand<br>The good I want to do<br>I don&apos;t actually do<br>And depending on the sin<br>I don&apos;t even feel bothered<br>Then I stumble upon Your word<br>And I am Confronted<br><br>It&apos;s no use pretending everything is alright<br>If I received forgiveness from You<br>But I can&apos;t forgive anyone<br>I didn&apos;t turn the other cheek<br>I only listened to my ego<br>I even loved my friends<br>But I hated my enemies<br><br>In my hypocrisy<br>I thought myself better than others<br>Without noticing the log<br>That was in my own eye<br><br>In sheep&apos;s clothing<br>Acting like a wolf<br>I forgot the Kingdom<br>Gathering my treasures<br><br>Oh, Jesus, break my pride<br>And make me look at the cross<br>Take away the hardness of my heart<br>On my knees I beg Your forgiveness<br>For Your grace throws my flesh to the ground<br>And teaches me the value of communion<br>Of drinking the wine and sharing the bread<br><br>I am the vessel, You are the potter<br>Break my life, remake me entirely<br>I take up my cross and deny myself<br>For I am no longer a prisoner of sin<br>Even with flaws, this is my desire<br><br>Give me a heart like Yours Give me a heart like Yours, my master<br>Give me a heart like Yours<br>A heart willing to obey<br>To fulfill all Your will<br><br>Give me a heart like Yours<b